I removed `state-rw` and the `last-input` write. The component was rejected because the node's `with` clause grants only http-client, notifier and wall-clock. The graph definition hasn't been updated yet, so the extra grant can't be linked. Once the `with` clause includes `state-rw`, the import and the `put` call can be added back.

